<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Commission shall meet at least once a month at such time and place as may be determined by the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
