<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The quorum of the Commission shall be seven including the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If the quorum as provided by subsection (4) is not present due to members being disqualified under section 11 or 25, then the quorum shall not be less than five."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_II__cl_13> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
