<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The quorum for every selection meeting shall be seven."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
