<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any vote taken at the selection meeting must be made by secret ballot and by majority decision. Disqualification from selection meeting"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
