<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_25> <https://schema.org/text> "A member of the Commission is disqualified from attending or participating in a selection meeting if he is being considered for selection or where section 11 applies. Report on recommendation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
