<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Prime Minister has accepted any of the persons recommended by the Commission, he may proceed to tender his advice in accordance with Article 122b of the Federal Constitution. Judicial commissioners may apply to be High Court judges"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
