<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act applies to the appointments of judges of the Federal Court, Court of Appeal and High Court and judicial commissioners and shall include the appointments of the Chief Justice of the Federal Court, the President of the Court of Appeal, the Chief Judge of the High Court in Malaya, the Chief Judge of the High Court in Sabah and Sarawak made on or after the commencement of this Act. Upholding independence of judiciary"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
