<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Prime Minister must uphold the continued independence of the judiciary and must have regard to—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
