<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_V__cl_33> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who wilfully gives to the Commission any information which is false or misleading in support of any candidacy for selection under this Act commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to both. Influencing or attempting to influence the Commission"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_V__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_V__cl_34> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "34" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
