<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@/~part_V__cl_35> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution in respect of any offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the consent of the Public Prosecutor. Public servant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/27/eng@> .
